1
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:28,120
♪I scaled sheer cliffs for lingzhi,
then found you gathering moonlight♪

2
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:33,420
♪Two baskets of silver glow
rang out like stone against steel♪

3
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:37,100
♪You said to cure me of my hesitation♪

4
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,930
♪I'd need nine measures
of wind from the cliffs♪

5
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:45,280
♪And three measures of a heartbeat
that stops when our eyes meet♪

6
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:49,900
♪I caught your wrist and said♪

7
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:54,450
♪This condition is already beyond cure♪

8
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,860
=Hanyi Enters The Heart=

9
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:59,780
=Episode 17=

10
00:01:04,700 --> 00:01:05,550
Father, look.

11
00:01:05,710 --> 00:01:07,180
This is the man-eating flower totem.

12
00:01:07,310 --> 00:01:08,230
Mother said

13
00:01:08,230 --> 00:01:10,310
(Xiao Shiqi, Great General Zhenyuan)
it's a mark of the God of War's favor.

14
00:01:10,310 --> 00:01:13,150
(Young Xiao Jing)
It will help me dominate the battlefield

15
00:01:13,310 --> 00:01:14,500
and win every battle.

16
00:01:16,470 --> 00:01:17,660
This flower suits my son

17
00:01:17,830 --> 00:01:19,020
perfectly.

18
00:01:20,540 --> 00:01:23,060
You will surely follow in my footsteps

19
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:24,280
and command the three armies.

20
00:01:25,630 --> 00:01:27,590
The Young Master has had a hard life.

21
00:01:28,170 --> 00:01:29,850
He wasn't meant
to take his mother's surname.

22
00:01:30,350 --> 00:01:33,220
He is Great General Xiao Shiqi's
own flesh and blood.

23
00:01:34,070 --> 00:01:37,150
But Xiao Shiqi never
intended to acknowledge him.

24
00:01:40,220 --> 00:01:41,860
In Xiao Shiqi's eyes,

25
00:01:42,350 --> 00:01:45,390
the Young Master was worth less
than a beggar on the street.

26
00:01:45,790 --> 00:01:48,430
Xiao Shiqi never
even spared him a glance.

27
00:01:49,620 --> 00:01:50,670
Do you know

28
00:01:50,980 --> 00:01:52,940
what the Young Master did

29
00:01:52,980 --> 00:01:55,940
just to win a little affection from

30
00:01:56,300 --> 00:01:57,540
his coldhearted father?

31
00:01:59,500 --> 00:02:01,230
To please his father,

32
00:02:02,310 --> 00:02:06,420
he carved a man-eating flower
on the back of his hand too.

33
00:02:10,830 --> 00:02:11,470
Father.

34
00:02:12,620 --> 00:02:14,340
Now I have
the same flower as my brother.

35
00:02:14,540 --> 00:02:15,700
It can protect you, Father.

36
00:02:18,180 --> 00:02:19,510
You wretched brat!

37
00:02:19,730 --> 00:02:21,160
Who gave you permission
to carve that flower?

38
00:02:22,030 --> 00:02:23,390
What a pathetic imitation.

39
00:02:23,620 --> 00:02:24,670
You must have a death wish.

40
00:02:24,670 --> 00:02:25,410
Get away from me!

41
00:02:26,620 --> 00:02:27,110
Father!

42
00:02:27,340 --> 00:02:28,540
I'm your child too.

43
00:02:29,780 --> 00:02:31,030
If I ever see you again,

44
00:02:31,620 --> 00:02:32,780
I'll break your legs!

45
00:02:33,540 --> 00:02:34,030
Father.

46
00:02:40,310 --> 00:02:41,260
I still remember

47
00:02:41,900 --> 00:02:44,030
when the Young Master was just born,

48
00:02:44,830 --> 00:02:46,180
Lady Xie held him in her arms

49
00:02:47,180 --> 00:02:48,870
and knelt in the freezing snow.

50
00:02:49,830 --> 00:02:51,620
She kowtowed countless times

51
00:02:52,060 --> 00:02:53,780
just to secure a surname for him.

52
00:02:54,390 --> 00:02:56,510
But the matriarch
of the Xiao family intervened

53
00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:58,520
and refused to let him
bear the General's surname.

54
00:02:58,670 --> 00:03:00,140
She even forbade Lady Xie and her son

55
00:03:00,180 --> 00:03:01,900
from setting foot
in the General's Residence.

56
00:03:03,750 --> 00:03:04,910
From then on,

57
00:03:06,300 --> 00:03:11,300
Xiao Shiqi completely
ignored Lady Xie and her son.

58
00:03:13,540 --> 00:03:14,790
In his eyes,

59
00:03:15,510 --> 00:03:18,260
only his precious
legitimate son mattered.

60
00:03:18,910 --> 00:03:22,260
He had no place
for his mistress and their son.

61
00:03:25,670 --> 00:03:29,740
His legitimate son, Xiao Jing?

62
00:03:31,260 --> 00:03:35,580
The Young Master
truly had a pitiful life.

63
00:03:42,540 --> 00:03:43,300
Thank you.

64
00:04:17,540 --> 00:04:18,070
It's snowing.

65
00:04:20,390 --> 00:04:21,110
Let's go home.

66
00:04:21,790 --> 00:04:22,260
Mas...

67
00:04:23,630 --> 00:04:24,420
Master.

68
00:04:25,020 --> 00:04:25,860
Look carefully.

69
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:28,740
I'm a beautiful young woman,

70
00:04:29,110 --> 00:04:30,190
not your Master.

71
00:04:33,640 --> 00:04:35,240
I haven't seen him
in quite some time either.

72
00:04:35,980 --> 00:04:38,910
Do you know where he went?

73
00:04:59,460 --> 00:05:00,190
Master.

74
00:05:03,070 --> 00:05:05,930
♪Every step is hard,
every step fraught with danger♪

75
00:05:06,690 --> 00:05:09,630
♪Every step is a battle with no retreat♪

76
00:05:10,290 --> 00:05:12,680
♪As dawn approaches, those still asleep♪

77
00:05:12,700 --> 00:05:13,340
Master.

78
00:05:15,460 --> 00:05:16,220
I was wrong.

79
00:05:18,190 --> 00:05:18,950
Don't cry.

80
00:05:22,340 --> 00:05:22,780
I...

81
00:05:24,100 --> 00:05:25,660
I never should have done any of that.

82
00:05:25,830 --> 00:05:27,460
How could I have doubted you?

83
00:05:29,780 --> 00:05:32,220
I even imprisoned you and tormented you.

84
00:05:33,190 --> 00:05:33,950
Master.

85
00:05:34,510 --> 00:05:35,750
I was wrong.

86
00:05:37,780 --> 00:05:38,580
It's all right,

87
00:05:39,580 --> 00:05:40,340
Li.

88
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:42,760
♪If fate had not woven its threads
and spurred everything along♪

89
00:05:42,780 --> 00:05:44,070
I don't blame you.

90
00:05:45,950 --> 00:05:47,190
I was the one at fault.

91
00:05:48,480 --> 00:05:50,410
As long as you don't blame me,
that's all that matters.

92
00:05:53,100 --> 00:05:54,340
No, Master.

93
00:05:55,140 --> 00:05:56,140
It was all my fault.

94
00:05:56,700 --> 00:05:58,310
I was wrong.

95
00:06:00,290 --> 00:06:07,900
♪However distant the past,
however far the future♪

96
00:06:08,300 --> 00:06:10,340
♪I stand here today♪

97
00:06:10,340 --> 00:06:14,660
♪Unable to turn back,
with no shore in sight♪

98
00:06:14,860 --> 00:06:22,570
♪Between black and white, once a piece
is placed, there is no regret♪

99
00:06:22,890 --> 00:06:24,260
♪You stepped into the game yourself♪

100
00:06:24,260 --> 00:06:26,670
♪Shielding me from hidden arrows♪

101
00:06:27,080 --> 00:06:34,660
♪Leaving me to a lifetime of solitude♪

102
00:06:47,630 --> 00:06:48,390
Miss Shen.

103
00:06:49,510 --> 00:06:50,900
You really can be heartless.

104
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:52,310
But after everything that's happened,

105
00:06:52,310 --> 00:06:53,310
surely you must realize

106
00:06:54,020 --> 00:06:56,140
how deeply he cares for you now.

107
00:07:00,430 --> 00:07:02,340
What do you mean?

108
00:07:02,900 --> 00:07:04,260
You have a place in his heart.

109
00:07:04,700 --> 00:07:05,990
Not as his disciple,

110
00:07:06,700 --> 00:07:07,870
but as the woman he loves.

111
00:07:09,210 --> 00:07:10,880
He planned everything
to pave the way for you

112
00:07:11,210 --> 00:07:12,650
and shielded you from every hardship.

113
00:07:12,990 --> 00:07:14,290
He always put you first,

114
00:07:14,290 --> 00:07:15,290
giving you everything he had,

115
00:07:15,660 --> 00:07:17,340
even risking his life to protect you.

116
00:07:18,290 --> 00:07:20,090
His feelings have long gone beyond
those of a master for his disciple.

117
00:07:21,460 --> 00:07:22,260
And you

118
00:07:22,870 --> 00:07:24,390
have feelings for him too, don't you?

119
00:07:25,630 --> 00:07:26,830
Love often begins

120
00:07:27,550 --> 00:07:28,630
without us knowing when.

121
00:07:30,190 --> 00:07:30,990
I hope you

122
00:07:31,830 --> 00:07:33,020
stay true to your heart

123
00:07:34,410 --> 00:07:35,410
and cherish the one who truly loves you.

124
00:08:29,750 --> 00:08:30,510
You're awake.

125
00:08:32,830 --> 00:08:36,660
Are you going to kill me, General?

126
00:08:37,310 --> 00:08:38,990
I'm suspicious by nature

127
00:08:39,390 --> 00:08:40,780
and fond of testing people's hearts.

128
00:08:41,550 --> 00:08:42,830
I only wanted to know

129
00:08:45,190 --> 00:08:46,510
whether you were afraid of me.

130
00:08:52,830 --> 00:08:53,900
Then, General,

131
00:08:55,190 --> 00:08:57,100
would you rather I fear you

132
00:08:57,430 --> 00:08:58,310
or love you?

133
00:09:02,700 --> 00:09:04,020
The latter, of course.

134
00:09:04,950 --> 00:09:05,700
In that case,

135
00:09:07,510 --> 00:09:08,660
please don't

136
00:09:09,070 --> 00:09:10,550
frighten me like that again.

137
00:09:12,340 --> 00:09:13,700
My heart can barely take it.

138
00:09:23,510 --> 00:09:26,550
All right. As you wish.

139
00:09:27,700 --> 00:09:28,220
By the way,

140
00:09:30,030 --> 00:09:31,460
have you ever touched

141
00:09:33,150 --> 00:09:34,620
my wrist guard?

142
00:09:39,790 --> 00:09:40,380
Never.

143
00:09:45,790 --> 00:09:46,220
Good.

144
00:09:48,620 --> 00:09:49,700
Get some rest.

145
00:10:20,860 --> 00:10:22,950
Greetings, Your Highness.

146
00:10:23,380 --> 00:10:25,030
No need for formalities,
Deputy Director Shen.

147
00:10:26,910 --> 00:10:27,940
You didn't come today

148
00:10:28,500 --> 00:10:30,220
just to check my pulse, did you?

149
00:10:32,270 --> 00:10:32,950
Tell me.

150
00:10:33,460 --> 00:10:34,620
Why are you here?

151
00:10:39,910 --> 00:10:41,000
You may leave us.

152
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:41,380
- Yes.
- Yes.

153
00:10:41,380 --> 00:10:42,220
Close the door.

154
00:10:48,190 --> 00:10:49,270
I understand now.

155
00:10:50,380 --> 00:10:52,580
His Majesty sent you to kill me,

156
00:10:53,190 --> 00:10:53,790
didn't he?

157
00:10:54,980 --> 00:10:56,550
Even though I never revealed her secret

158
00:10:56,550 --> 00:10:57,830
to anyone,

159
00:10:58,340 --> 00:10:59,860
I'm still doomed to die.

160
00:11:01,400 --> 00:11:02,650
You've misunderstood, Your Highness.

161
00:11:03,380 --> 00:11:04,950
I'm not here to take your life.

162
00:11:05,380 --> 00:11:07,340
His Majesty has no intention
of killing you either.

163
00:11:08,380 --> 00:11:09,460
He merely ordered me

164
00:11:09,980 --> 00:11:11,550
to find a way to erase your memory.

165
00:11:29,200 --> 00:11:32,060
♪Every step is hard,
every step fraught with danger♪

166
00:11:32,820 --> 00:11:35,760
♪Every step is a battle with no retreat♪

167
00:11:36,420 --> 00:11:39,240
♪As dawn approaches, those still asleep♪

168
00:11:40,090 --> 00:11:43,080
♪Know nothing
of the bitter cold of the long night♪

169
00:11:43,930 --> 00:11:47,250
♪If fate had not woven its threads
and spurred everything along♪

170
00:11:47,590 --> 00:11:50,880
♪How could we witness life's upheavals
and the passing of time?♪

171
00:11:51,230 --> 00:11:57,710
♪If this grand dream is destined to
be absurd, with no answer to be found♪

172
00:11:58,500 --> 00:12:05,590
♪How I wish that when I wake,
I could still be by your side♪

173
00:12:08,090 --> 00:12:15,940
♪However distant the past,
however far the future♪

174
00:12:16,240 --> 00:12:18,050
♪I stand here today♪

175
00:12:18,190 --> 00:12:22,700
♪Unable to turn back,
with no shore in sight♪

176
00:12:22,700 --> 00:12:30,190
♪Between black and white, once a piece
is placed, there is no regret♪

177
00:12:30,830 --> 00:12:32,120
♪You stepped into the game yourself♪

178
00:12:32,120 --> 00:12:34,520
♪Shielding me from hidden arrows♪

179
00:12:34,960 --> 00:12:41,810
♪Leaving me to a lifetime of solitude♪
